+<!-- beyond1q: privileged permissions for the IMS media service.
+     CAPTURE_AUDIO_OUTPUT is required so AudioPolicyManager does not silence
+     the IMS capture client during an active call (VoLTE uplink). Mirrors the
+     A15 tree (fengkeqei/ImsMedia, Round 71). -->
